68	    /**
69	     * Pattern for a syntactically valid email address: a non-empty local part, an '@', and a
70	     * dotted domain ending in a letters-only label. Applied to the trimmed, lower-cased value.
71	     */
72	    /**
73	     * Dedicated audit logger. Successful side-effects (e.g. owner creation) are recorded here so
74	     * they can be routed and asserted independently of the application's diagnostic logging.
